kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20230410900918"},{"id":"D35","kind":"DART 공시","title":"전환사채(해외전환사채포함)발행후만기전사채취득","date":"2023-04-04","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20230404900496"},{"id":"D36","kind":"DART 공시","title":"전환가액의조정","date":"2023-03-17","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20230317900694"},{"id":"D37","kind":"DART 공시","title":"유상증자또는주식관련사채등의청약결과(자율공시)","date":"2023-03-15","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20230315900359"},{"id":"D38","kind":"DART 공시","title":"유상증자또는주식관련사채등의청약결과(자율공시)","date":"2023-03-10","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20230310900146"},{"id":"D39","kind":"DART 공시","title":"유상증자최종발행가액확정","date":"2023-03-06","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20230306900214"},{"id":"D40","kind":"DART 공시","title":"권리락(유상증자)","date":"2023-02-06","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20230206901059"},{"id":"R","kind":"DART 사업보고서","title":"사업보고서 (2024.12) 'II. 사업의 내용'","date":"2025-03-20","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20250320001712"}]}